/**
 * Hand-maintained widget names, in serialization order, for what the Comfy Registry does not
 * describe: core ComfyUI and frontend nodes (core is not a Registry pack, and custom packs reuse
 * some core class names), custom nodes missing from the Registry, and older node versions it no
 * longer lists. Everything else comes from registryWidgetNames.json, generated by
 * scripts/generate-comfy-registry-widgets.mjs; do not add a node version the Registry already has.
 *
 * ComfyUI saves widget values positionally (`widgets_values`) and only newer frontends also record
 * every widget's name in `inputs`. Order follows each node's INPUT_TYPES (required, then optional).
 * Trailing names a version does not have are harmless; ComfyUI's unserialized
 * `control_after_generate` value is inserted separately after seed widgets and is not listed here.
 */
